OL,3,GNEWSA'Holy grail of whisky' sells for
OL,4,A#2.1m at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare bottle of Scotch whisky
OL,7,Fdistilled 100 years ago has sold for
OL,8,F#2.1m ($2.8m) at a Sotheby's auction in
OL,9,FScotland.
OL,11,FSold at the Macallan Estate in
OL,12,FSpeyside, it saw the Macallan 1926
OL,13,Fbecame the second most valuable bottle
OL,14,Fof whisky ever sold, when measured in
OL,15,Fpounds.
OL,17,FIt narrowly missed out on the previous
OL,18,Frecord set by the Adami Edition of the
OL,19,Fsame whisky from the same cask which
OL,20,Ffetched slightly more in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
