OL,3,GNEWSA'Holy grail of whisky' sells for
OL,4,A#2.1m at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe spirit was bottled in 1986 after
OL,7,Fmaturing for 60 years, with just 40
OL,8,Fbottles drawn from a single sherry
OL,9,Fseasoned oak cask.
